      "normalized_latin": "nec veterum exemplo nec prelatorum precepto",
      "reason": "A contraction mark over the initial p and the genitive plural ending support prelatorum, “of prelates.” The two phrases give the example of the ancients and the command of the prelates as reasons for a monk to write.",
